A disjunction which other declarations resolve to one of its branches.
Trimming must keep the result the same.

-- a.cue --
a: {x: 1, k: "a"} | {y: 2, k: "b"}
a: k: "a"
a: x: 1
-- out/trim-v3 --
== a.cue
a: {x: 1, k: "a"} | {y: 2, k: "b"}
a: k: "a"
a: x: 1
-- out/trim-v3-noshare --
== a.cue
a: {x: 1, k: "a"} | {y: 2, k: "b"}
a: k: "a"
a: x: 1
